      PICKS: NOR, VER, PIA\n            </span>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"round-card past\" data-kid=\"1-3-7\" data-name=\"past round 07 card\">\n            <span class=\"round-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-1\" data-name=\"round metadata\">\n                ROUND 07 • MAY 15–17\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"round-num\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2\" data-name=\"round number\">\n                07\n            </span>\n            <strong class=\"round-name\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-3\" data-name=\"round name title\">\n                Emilia Romagna Grand Prix\n            </strong>\n            <span class=\"round-subtitle\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-4\" data-name=\"round location subtitle\">\n                Autodromo Enzo e Dino Ferrari • Imola\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"round-footer\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-5\" data-name=\"round footer summary\">\n                PICKS: VER, LEC, HAM\n            </span>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"round-card past\" data-kid=\"1-3-8\" data-name=\"past round 08 card\">\n            <span class=\"round-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-1\" data-name=\"round metadata\">\n                ROUND 08 • MAY 22–24\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"round-num\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-2\" data-name=\"round number\">\n                08\n            </span>\n            <strong class=\"round-name\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-3\" data-name=\"round name title\">\n                Monaco Grand Prix\n            </strong>\n            <span class=\"round-subtitle\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-4\" data-name=\"round location subtitle\">\n                Circuit de Monaco • Monte Carlo\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"round-footer\" data-kid=\"1-3-8-5\" data-name=\"round footer summary\">\n                PICKS: LEC, VER, RUS\n            </span>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"round-card past\" data-kid=\"1-3-9\" data-name=\"past round 09 card\">\n            <span class=\"round-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-9-1\